<title>USA: Big Spring ISD, Texas won by First Southwest.</title>
<headline>Big Spring ISD, Texas won by First Southwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Southwest said it won $12.520 million of Big Spring ISD, Texas, school building bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.549 percent.</p>
</text>
